{
    "title": "Chess Royale - Play and Learn",
    "description": "<b>\u265f\ufe0f THE ONLY CHESS APP YOU NEED </b>\u265f\ufe0f\r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re a complete beginner or a highly experienced player, Chess Royale has everything you could need to enjoy one of the world\u2019s greatest board games on your mobile device. Play with the AI, with friends, or with millions of strangers all over the world, then train your chess skills with tutorials, puzzles, and post-game analysis. One of the greatest things about chess is that there\u2019s always something new to learn, and this beautifully designed app will allow you to keep on discovering the magic of chess and enhancing your love of the game day after day.\r\n\r\n<b>WHY CHESS?</b> \ud83e\udd14\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd70 With a history that stretches back over millennia, chess is both a vital cultural artefact and a beloved pastime that brings together millions of players all over the world.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd70 Renowned as a fierce test of the intellect, chess provides incredible training for your brain. Regularly playing chess and solving puzzles can train your strategic skills, develop logical and lateral thinking, help with learning and understanding psychology, improve your analysis and enhance your memory.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd70 It\u2019s fun! Chess may be intimidating for beginners, but the more you learn and the better you understand the game, the more entertaining and rewarding it becomes. There\u2019s some reason why it has remained among the most popular board games in the world for centuries, after all.\r\n\r\n<b>WHY CHESS ROYALE?</b>\r\n\r\n\u2b1c\ufe0f\u2b1b\ufe0f<b>It pays to be popular:</b> With over 50 000 000 players across all popular platforms, Chess Royale ensures there\u2019s always a real opponent of similar skill online and ready to play in a variety of multiplayer formats.\r\n\r\n\u2b1b\ufe0f\u2b1c\ufe0f<b>Endless variations: </b>Not only can you challenge real players of different skill levels, you can also play in eight different modes. Play blitzes with varying time limitations, use the notifications system to play with friends when they\u2019re online, test yourself in private against the game\u2019s AI, and enter and arrange tournaments of various formats for more multiplayer fun.\r\n\r\n\u2b1c\ufe0f\u2b1b\ufe0f<b>More than just a game: </b>Chess Royale boasts more than 5000 chess puzzles to help you train specific aspects of your game. The app also features analysis tools that you can use post-match to help with your learning and development. And there is a trainer for beginners and more advanced players to get a better grasp of this intensely rich and complex game.\r\n\r\n\u2b1b\ufe0f\u2b1c\ufe0f<b>Beautiful and smart:</b> Chess Royale\u2019s clean, intuitive design is enhanced with dozens of unique boards, figures and avatars, so you can create the perfectly customised playing environment.\r\n\r\n<b>THE BOARD GAME THAT\u2019S NEVER BORING</b>\r\n\r\nDespite the wonders of modern technology, you\u2019ll be hard pressed to find a mobile game that\u2019s as challenging, enjoyable, and intellectually satisfying as chess. Whether you\u2019re looking for just a new game to play online or a trainer to help you take the very first steps in exploring the magic of chess,  \u265f\ufe0f Chess Royale offers something extra. Download the app now to discover the ultimate mobile chess environment.\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy:\u00a0https://say.games/privacy-policy\r\nTerms of Use:\u00a0https://say.games/terms-of-use",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>\u265f\ufe0f THE ONLY CHESS APP YOU NEED </b>\u265f\ufe0f<br><br>Whether you\u2019re a complete beginner or a highly experienced player, Chess Royale has everything you could need to enjoy one of the world\u2019s greatest board games on your mobile device. Play with the AI, with friends, or with millions of strangers all over the world, then train your chess skills with tutorials, puzzles, and post-game analysis. One of the greatest things about chess is that there\u2019s always something new to learn, and this beautifully designed app will allow you to keep on discovering the magic of chess and enhancing your love of the game day after day.<br><br><b>WHY CHESS?</b> \ud83e\udd14<br><br>\ud83d\udd70 With a history that stretches back over millennia, chess is both a vital cultural artefact and a beloved pastime that brings together millions of players all over the world.<br><br>\ud83d\udd70 Renowned as a fierce test of the intellect, chess provides incredible training for your brain. Regularly playing chess and solving puzzles can train your strategic skills, develop logical and lateral thinking, help with learning and understanding psychology, improve your analysis and enhance your memory.<br><br>\ud83d\udd70 It\u2019s fun! Chess may be intimidating for beginners, but the more you learn and the better you understand the game, the more entertaining and rewarding it becomes. There\u2019s some reason why it has remained among the most popular board games in the world for centuries, after all.<br><br><b>WHY CHESS ROYALE?</b><br><br>\u2b1c\ufe0f\u2b1b\ufe0f<b>It pays to be popular:</b> With over 50 000 000 players across all popular platforms, Chess Royale ensures there\u2019s always a real opponent of similar skill online and ready to play in a variety of multiplayer formats.<br><br>\u2b1b\ufe0f\u2b1c\ufe0f<b>Endless variations: </b>Not only can you challenge real players of different skill levels, you can also play in eight different modes. Pl